### CareTrack API examples
### Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ's HTTP client.
### Start the backend first (cd backend && ./mvnw spring-boot:run).
### Replace CT-XXXXXX with the referenceNumber returned by "Create a request".

@base = http://localhost:8080

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- customer

### Create a request (201 Created + Location header)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jordan Rivera",
  "category": "SERVICE_ISSUE",
  "subject": "No signal after software update",
  "description": "Since installing this morning's update the phone shows 'No service' everywhere."
}

### List the demo customer's requests (most recently updated first)
GET {{base}}/api/customer/requests

### Get one request with its history (seed data example)
GET {{base}}/api/customer/requests/CT-100002

### Add a customer message (201; status does NOT change)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests/CT-100002/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "It's a Nimbus X2 and restarting didn't help." }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- agent

### List all requests, optionally filtered
GET {{base}}/api/agent/requests?status=IN_PROGRESS&category=BILLING

### Get any request (agent can see every customer's requests)
GET {{base}}/api/agent/requests/CT-100005

### Customer-visible update (201; status does NOT change)
POST {{base}}/api/agent/requests/CT-100002/updates
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Thanks. We've asked the network team to check the nearest site." }

### Change status (201). WAITING_ON_CUSTOMER -> IN_PROGRESS is allowed.
POST {{base}}/api/agent/requests/CT-100002/status-changes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "IN_PROGRESS", "explanation": "Customer replied with device details." }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- errors

### 409 Conflict: OPEN -> RESOLVED skips a step (CT-100003 is OPEN in seed data)
POST {{base}}/api/agent/requests/CT-100003/status-changes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "RESOLVED", "explanation": "Trying to skip ahead." }

### 400 Bad Request: whitespace-only subject, missing category
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Jordan", "subject": "   ", "description": "Too short" }

### 400 Bad Request: unknown filter value
GET {{base}}/api/agent/requests?status=DONE

### 404 Not Found: unknown reference
GET {{base}}/api/customer/requests/CT-ZZZZZZ

### 404 Not Found: a real request that belongs to a different (non-demo) customer
GET {{base}}/api/customer/requests/CT-100004
